{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/STU_4eMbZImNphM-OEQ7vw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:56.244617+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/STU_4eMbZImNphM-OEQ7vw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sV6LWvJ52uAG5uhWhcib3l0F39icgdNIo3A3kAfyrkLzOYO0GicEuUJBbsiatFYSwLglbaEEtktytRHug/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>大湾区 </span></strong></span><strong><span>·</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span> 新药梦</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><span><strong><span>2025年</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>大学生夏令营</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>报名开启</span></strong></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKQmKQ5qloZcsfxsmK2oziboC7LJ6vLWWdSrV29I7qoia7R0UBMibLhCHtg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>中科中山药物创新研究院夏令营旨在为优秀大学生提供一个学术互动交流学习的平台，增进学生对生命科学研究领域前沿了解，拓宽科学视野，培养实践能力，开启创新思维，激发科研兴趣，推动生命科学领域的人才培养。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><strong><strong><span>1.</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>时间安排：</span></strong></strong><span>2025年8月26日-28日（具体时间如有调整将进一步通知）。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><strong><span>2.</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>活动方式：</span></strong></strong><span>线下组织。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><strong><span>3.</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>活动</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>内容</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>：</span></strong></strong><span>包括开营仪式、学术讲座、导师沙龙、园区参观、师兄师姐见面会等。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>.</span></strong></strong><strong><strong><span>活动费用：</span></strong></strong><span>夏令营期间不收取任何费用，免费提供食宿。营员请自行预订往返车票，夏令营期间中途退出者需自行承担相关费用。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请</span><strong><span>条件</span></strong></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.招募对象：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>化学、生物学、医学、药学、中药学</span></span></strong><span><span>等相关学科的大学四年制本科三年级、五年制本科四年级学生，</span></span><strong><span><span>综合性大学的化学和生物学本科生将优先招募</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.成绩要求：</span></span></strong><span><span>本科期间专业排名为前50%，双一流重点高校学生学习成绩标准可再适当放宽；英语达到国家四级合格水平（425分以上）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.其他要求：对科研有浓厚兴趣，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，同时诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请报名</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>从</span><strong><strong><span>招募启事发布之日</span></strong></strong><span>起至8月18日前，请进入链接（https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DZUdaR1RvT3BReVJk）进行报名，或者扫描下方二维码完成报名登记。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKdaeAxVylHia4yuat72zn0SktQFD6QIk9jpEPgia7ADsiaSXfCp3ibOu4pw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><span>营员选拔期间中山药创院将公布入营名单，具体入营名单将于“中科中山药物创新研究院-研究生教育-招生工作”发布。</span></span></p><p><span><span>网址：https://www.zidd.ac.cn/graduateeducationservice/list.aspx。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>营员选拔</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>夏令营由中山药创院研究生部主办，选拔资格初审通过的本科生可参加本次夏令营活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>中山药创院导师详细介绍（含联系方式）见“中山药创院官网-研究生教育-导师介绍”（https://www.zidd.ac.cn/PostdoctoralWorkstation/list.aspx）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>招生政策宣讲</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><span>2025年8月-11月期间，中山药创院还将举办线上宣讲，详细介绍联培高校招生政策和研究生培养情况，请关注上述网站相关活动通知。</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>招生联系人：</span></span></p><p><span><span>龙老师：（0760）8613 9141</span></span></p><p><span><span>招生邮箱：longxiaoyan@zidd.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年夏令营招生咨询QQ群: 1049020434</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKavAFbGaKiaJEa8tybtwibCMSLgvhgLvicVMf1dhibFOKqibcchjaOdrSefg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>7</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>往期回顾</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDK5TR3BV9JuNCGkH1diaujJW0wB8yCB2lciavqVC9Hp5e5gSgPvNdpDSFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKfauZicV4NSeexDaRvfElLezSZR4icfataqiaiagyj5xXpLnnb1aV8f7Z8A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKATVJFOn2bibDhhF9hEMhAXNwnb1piaXBOhX5Jlq6j0AIdGXxgLAiaIIWg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>左右滑动查看更多</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>研究院简介</span></span></span></strong></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中科中山药物创新研究院（简称“中山药创院”）是由中山市人民政府于2018年在中山翠亨新区建设的新型研发机构。作为全市首家科研型省级事业单位，中山药创院已启动粤港澳大湾区国家技术创新中心分中心培育建设，已获批博士后科研工作站、广东省高水平创新研究院、广东省高水平新型研发机构、广东省博士工作站。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>中山药创院“五个一”建设目标（一个研究院、一个药学院、一个产业化服务平台、一个研发型企业孵化基地、一个基金）已取得初步成果。现已全球引进科研领军人才（包括“杰青”获得者11位），组建49个科研创新团队，在册硕、博士联合培养研究生近700人，在站博士后36人。全院人员逾1000人。累计已有5项一类新药成果转化；发表论文超570篇，立项国家、中国科学院、省部级及其他各类项目近200项；申请和授权专利超120件。牵头组建中山市生物医药创投基金（总规模10亿元），已决策投资18个优质项目，其中14家企业落地中山，并孵化出13个获得临床批件的新药。</span></span></p><p><span><span>在中山市政府支持下，中山药创院联合区域内高校及科研院所力量，通过“医产学研资”的深度融合，探索“高校+研究所”合作培养新模式。已与中国药科大学、遵义医科大学、贵州医科大学、南方医科大学、大连理工大学、石河子大学、暨南大学、清华大学深圳国际研究生院、南京中医药大学、广州中医药大学、广东药科大学、广州医科大学、澳门大学、澳门科技大学签署研究生联合培养合作协议，开展研究生联合培养。同时作为省级重大创新平台，将着力提升源头创新能级，加快科技成果转移转化，助力推动科技创新和产业创新深度融合，打造世界一流的原创新药研发机构，建设生物医药人才高地、成果转化高地、原创新药研发高地。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sUiaZL89se2eJiaEZnPAIhI9OMXdcvwXmD8ic6orgXVguxrFNOib8pnM0OwP820g48gF8wE1Gn8EhWicibw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>办公室</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sUiaZL89se2eJiaEZnPAIhI9ONKKpWia5N3V4GiaxrynpibzarPtnepHFO2Zv4fVv9qjNz5LkzvDxcxU9A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>实验室</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKW9byRz4E4HGV3NMnC46YsOibP6pHk0CicQbUjutrIgZxcxibIeDdCANWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKMKJRK4eK9RichnqRfYmSMuv9Plyo4NnDNgQZPzlosvoicXwOfFfwrEqQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><span>学术交流活动</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKEYlYw3twxv0euSdfJuwlawqm4HRd4sQ9f3VT4EibIqG8oicJWPtUm3qQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKVdsypicwDLqHXaLw2nZM3Z7CRGLFRmoJXvV7FzicJdmlKdnabXIee1iaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><span>丰富的业余生活</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/93bxXdNB1sVCOnUEmbEeaeice8Xic91LDKqtzrM1KTd5g89LB7mvQbribGELLTJRDMMCXvbQqnrXAXzlzyIoiapBOw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><strong><span>ZIDD期待您的加入！</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/93bxXdNB1sV6LWvJ52uAG5uhWhcib3l0FaTYr6Z79MqSA8Sc6gibcCcEVuZ8ZH1QrAAmKpFMMVZlgU6TzQED3zpw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f182c3d20c89b7b5c9bbe16e8ee96e94a2b31b6a996979c8d031d63b38b2b222","textLength":1734,"sourceSha256":"34f8ed362fc68e320438cae72ed2d2b41cb4ad52ebd7b21908d6f55448676835","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b6aa07d8c4646c62882f","title":"2025年中国科学院中科中山药物创新研究院大学生夏令营报名开启","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:56.244617+00:00"}
